          "start_time": 19.425,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s funny how after visiting China my enthusiasm for the country has been tempered.",
          "start_time": 1.775,
          "end_time": 7.625,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.425,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "真奇怪，去过中国之后，我对这个国家的热情反而消退了。",
          "start_time": 1.775,
          "end_time": 7.625,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.425,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s more so the realization that China is just using common sense in its approach to governance.",
          "start_time": 7.625,
          "end_time": 13.8,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.425,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "更确切地说，人们意识到中国在治理国家方面只是运用了常识。",
          "start_time": 7.625,
          "end_time": 13.8,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.425,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Me: “Oh, this is what a well-run society looks like. Shame we don’t have this back home.”",
          "start_time": 13.8,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.425,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "我：“哦，这才是运转良好的社会啊。可惜我们家乡没有这样的社会。”",
          "start_time": 13.8,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.425,
          "end_time": 19.425,
          "language": "en"
